				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "RPI: When code queries pragmas, it searches from the leaf class up to a given superclass (inclusive). However there is an exclusive version of that call, which might be simpler to use if we assumed \"Object\" as that superclass (excluded). If this were the case, then a methods on Metaclass #pragmasNamed:  and #classPragmasNamed:  would be a neater possibility. Lets collect some stats as to how useful tis improvement might be."
			},
